  This platform is dedicated to the participation and organization of treasure hunts. It will be based on the use of virtual and semi-virtual caches, enhanced by Augmented Reality (AR) technologies accessible via smartphones and tablets.<br/>
  The treasure hunt will be designed as a multifunctional tool: a fun medium for participants, but also a powerful communication and marketing vehicle for organizers wishing to promote their initiatives or brand.<br />
